  ogImage="https://djmisha.com/images/logo-djmisha.png"
  ogUrl="https://djmisha.com/services/wedding-dj-in-san-diego/"
  ogType="website"
  twitterTitle="Wedding DJ"
  twitterImage="https://djmisha.com/images/logo-djmisha.png"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <HeroSection
    backgroundImage={weddingHeroImages[0]}
    backgroundImages={weddingHeroImages}
    alt="Wedding DJ in San Diego"
    scrollTarget="#intro"
  >
    <p slot="headline">The Perfect Soundtrack for Your Special Day</p>
    <h1 slot="title">Wedding DJ in San Diego</h1>
  </HeroSection>

  <CenteredTextBlock id="intro" align="left">
    <p>
      Think about the most fun wedding you've attended. What do you remember? <br
      /><br />
      There's a good chance your time on the dance floor stands out. The music was
      pumping; the atmosphere was electric; and every song seemed to capture the essence
      of the couple&#8217;s love story. <br /><br />That&#8217;s the kind of
      unforgettable experience <a href="/about/" rel="nofollow" title=""
        >DJ Misha</a
      > strives to create.
    </p>

    <p>
      The music is one of the most important parts of the reception, and with DJ
      Misha, it's not just about playing track after track — it&#8217;s about
      creating a seamless blend of music that enhances the overall atmosphere of
      the night. He works closely with every couple to <a
        href="/blog/your-wedding-your-music-how-i-spin-a-dj-set-tailored-to-your-vision/"
        title="Your Wedding, Your Music: How I Spin a DJ Set Tailored to Your Vision"
        >design the perfect live DJ set</a
      >, making their wedding a dance party that creates lasting memories for
      years to come.
    </p>

    <center>
      <p>
        <strong
          >Your wedding is about you. Let's make the music match your vision.
        </strong>
      </p>
    </center>
  </CenteredTextBlock>

  <SectionNav links={navLinks} />

  <ImageTextSplit
    id="why-choose-dj-misha-for-your-wedding"
