    alt="DJing for 40th Birthday Party"
    caption="DJ Misha spinning dance records"
  >
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="Why DJ Misha"
      title="Why Choose DJ Misha for Your Wedding"
      align="left"
    />
    <p>
      With professional experience and today's sound, DJ Misha is one of the
      top-rated DJs in San Diego. He's committed to making your wedding special
      as he focuses on music that resonates with you. Here's a glimpse inside
      why his services are different from other wedding DJs.
    </p>
  </ImageTextSplit>

  <FeatureGrid alt={true}>
    <FeatureCard
      title="Crafts a Personalized Music Experience"
      icon="music-heart"
      iconSize="3.2em"
    >
