        cocktail hour, dinner, and dancing.
      </p>
      <p>Misha's wedding service package includes the following:</p>
    </Fragment>
    <ul class="wp-block-list">
      <li>
        DJ to handle the music and Master of Ceremony announcements for general
        event flow
      </li>
      <li>
        Event planning session and detailed event timeline review&nbsp;&nbsp;
      </li>
      <li>
        Coordination between other vendors, wedding planners, guests&nbsp;&nbsp;
      </li>
      <li>Full music consultation to understand the client expectations</li>
      <li>
        Gathering and organizing any special music needed for the night&nbsp;
      </li>
      <li>
        Sound system: 2 high-powered speakers, speaker stands, and DJ mixing
        booth
      </li>
      <li>
        Equipment setup and breakdown time; we arrive 2 hours before start of
        music
      </li>
      <li>Microphone for toasts and announcements&nbsp;</li>
    </ul>
  </ChecklistSection>

  <TestimonialQuote
    quote="DJ Misha was an absolute pleasure to work with! We consulted with Misha to perform at our wedding in Nantucket, MA. Despite communicating with him from across the country, Misha was extremely responsive throughout every stage of our planning process providing us with a lot of ease and comfort.<br /><br />The music for our wedding was very important to us, and Misha understood our vision from the very beginning. While we provided some guidance so that he could understand our style, we let him take a lot of creative freedom in curating the final playlist and it could not have been more perfect. As the bride, I did not leave the dance floor once, and neither did any of our guests. It was an absolute blast of a dance party and we could not recommend Misha enough! Would highly recommend for your wedding or next party."
    author="Amanda Liew via Google"
  />

  <PricingCallout
    id="cost-of-our-dj-services"
    heading="Cost of Our DJ Services"
    price="$2,500"
    priceLabel="STARTING AT"
    caption="Dance Party"
    secondaryPrice="$4,000"
    secondaryPriceLabel="MOST COUPLES SPEND ~"
    secondaryCaption="Full Wedding Day"
    eyebrow="Your Investment"
  >
    <p>
      <strong>
        Most couples spend around $4,000 for wedding DJ services in San Diego,
        which covers music for the ceremony, cocktail hour and a full reception.
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      Our dance-party-only package starts at $2,500 for 4 hours, with a
      professional grade sound system, dance floor lighting, and a microphone
